#: ../../language/error_codes/E0096.md:1
msgid "E0096"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0096.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `unfenced_import`"
msgstr "警告名称：`unfenced_import`"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0096.md:5
msgid ""
"An `.mbtx` script declares imports outside its frontmatter. This older "
"form is deprecated."
msgstr "`.mbtx` 脚本在 frontmatter 之外声明了导入。这种旧写法已弃用。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0096.md:8
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0096.md:10
msgid ""
"import {\n"
"  \"moonbitlang/core/queue\" @queue\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"fn main {\n"
"  println(@queue.Queue([1, 2]).length())\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0096.md:8
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0096.md:10
msgid ""
"Move the imports into frontmatter at the beginning of the script, "
"enclosed by `---` lines. Package imports in `moon.pkg` do not need these "
"delimiters."
msgstr "将导入移到脚本开头的 frontmatter 中，用 `---` 行包围。`moon.pkg` 中的包导入不需要这些分隔符。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0096.md:19
msgid ""
"---\n"
"import {\n"
"  \"moonbitlang/core/queue\" @queue\n"
"}\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"fn main {\n"
"  println(@queue.Queue([1, 2]).length())\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0096.md:17
msgid ""
"See [Running `.mbtx` Scripts](/toolchain/moon/script-mode.md) for "
"dependencies, aliases, and import-all syntax."
msgstr "依赖、别名和全量导入语法见[运行 `.mbtx` 脚本](/toolchain/moon/script-mode.md)。"
